# The whole-corpus render harness builds here so it cannot disturb `dist/`.
/dist-parity

# A generated content mirror once lived here. Nothing writes it any more — the submodule
# holds `.mdoc` directly and `content.config.ts` reads it there — but the rule STAYS,
# because the two failure modes are not symmetric: forgetting it once puts private
# content in a public repo, and that has very nearly happened.
/src/content

